  "notes": "Text Input is a simple input field.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/input/+page.md",
  "code": "<label class=\"input validator\">\n  <svg class=\"h-[1em] opacity-50\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n    <g\n      stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n      stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n      stroke-width=\"2.5\"\n      fill=\"none\"\n      stroke=\"currentColor\"\n    >\n      <path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path>\n      <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n    </g>\n  </svg>\n  <input\n    type=\"text\"\n    required\n    placeholder=\"Username\"\n    pattern=\"[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9\\\\-]*\"\n    minlength=\"3\"\n    maxlength=\"30\"\n    title=\"Only letters, numbers or dash\"\n  />\n</label>\n<p class=\"validator-hint\">\n  Must be 3 to 30 characters\n  <br />containing only letters, numbers or dash\n</p>",
